==== in-heading
<h2><a name="icodebxb-bybicode-1" class="anchor" href="#icodebxb-bybicode-1" aria-label="Heading link"></a><code>[b]x[/b] &lt;b&gt;y&lt;/b&gt;</code></h2>
==== around-b
<code>[b][b]x[/b] &lt;b&gt;y&lt;/b&gt;[/b]</code>
==== in-b
<span class="bbcode-b">before <code>[b]x[/b] &lt;b&gt;y&lt;/b&gt;</code> after</span>
==== in-core-quote
