<blockquote><code>[b]x[/b] &lt;b&gt;y&lt;/b&gt;</code></blockquote>
</aside>
==== misnested-with-i
<code>[i][b]x[/b] &lt;b&gt;y&lt;/b&gt;</code> tail[/i]
==== nested-in-itself
<code>outer [icode]inner[/icode] outer</code>
==== repeated
<code>one</code><code>two</code> <code>three</code>
